kflow call — :372 is a thin orchestrator (preflight -> assemble -> _run_code_review_gate). The actual code-review run_workflow call whose per-candidate spans must nest under the run span lives in _run_code_review_gate at :492. Opening the span in produce_code_review_verdict still transitively encloses that call, so the semantics hold, but the named edit site does not point at the run body the way the other two do.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff1ca182f2308b637","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope section, `:372 code-review` bullet; Approach 'Three boundaries' paragraph","norm_id":"n581e35c2ca06108b","priority":0.165,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer opens the span at :372 and, seeing no run_workflow there, is uncertain whether nesting reaches the :492 candidate spans"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Amend the Scope bullet to read `:372 produce_code_review_verdict opens the run span enclosing the downstream _run_code_review_gate run_workflow call (:492)`, so the named edit site and the run body are unambiguous.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing",